Hi, Skynet
============

A joke experimental platform for me to learn the Go language, without using AI to generate code.

Quick Start
-----------

git clone https://github.com/Vladislav-Kalinkin/hi-skynet
cd hi-skynet
go run main.go

AI Rules
-----------------------

In this project, it can only be used to study language functions as one of the replacements or additions to documentation.
It is forbidden to use it to create code in this repository
